Maintainer: ImageEditor <maintainer@example.com>
Depends: libqt6widgets6, libqt6gui6, libqt6core6, libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yourusername/ColorRemover
Description: Remove specific colors from images
 Color Remover is a Qt6-based application that allows users to
 remove specific colors from images. It provides an intuitive
 interface for color selection and image processing.
